DESCRIPTION:Professor Helen Onyeaka\nBringing Birmingham to You\n\nWhat rol
 e do microbes play in creating a more sustainable future? Microbes may be 
 invisible to the naked eye\, but their impact on our lives is enormous. Di
 scover how these remarkable living systems are helping researchers tackle 
 global challenges\, from food security and public health to climate change
  and sustainability. Join Professor Helen Onyeaka for an inspiring journey
  through the world of microbiology\, sustainability\, and innovation. From
  food security and public health to climate action and the circular bioeco
 nomy\, discover how her internationally recognised research is helping to 
 address some of the world's most pressing challenges and shape a more sust
 ainable future. Don't miss…\n\nDetails: https://www.birmingham.ac.uk/eve
 nts/bringing-birmingham-to-you-how-microbes-changed-my-world-a-journey-in-
 research-and-innovation
